{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["offline_access"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Create Price List"},"description":"Create a customer price list, as the Price lists page does. It starts as a draft in the tenant currency and prices nothing until activate_price_list publishes it; add its prices with append_price_list_lines and give it to customers with assign_price_list. code is unique (ignoring case). validFrom and validUntil are YYYY-MM-DD tenant-local days, both included; omit for no start or no end. isNet=true means its prices are final, with no discount taken off. unlistedItemRule: none (default; an item the list does not name falls through to the next list) or percent_of_item_price with unlistedItemPercent (70 = 70% of the item's price). isTenantDefault=true makes it the list for every sale no other list prices; only one default can be active. Requires an operator (unpinned) credential with Write + catalog.execute and an Admin.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"code":{"description":"A short unique code, up to 64 characters (WHOLESALE-2026).","type":["string","null"]},"idempotencyKey":{"default":null,"description":"Caller-generated idempotency key; required with previewReceipt to commit.","type":["string","null"]},"isNet":{"default":false,"description":"true: its prices are final, no discount is taken off.","type":"boolean"},"isTenantDefault":{"default":false,"description":"true: the list for every sale that no other list prices.","type":"boolean"},"name":{"description":"The list's name, up to 200 characters.","type":["string","null"]},"preview":{"default":false,"description":"Step 1 of the required two-step write: set true to validate and receive a structured preview plus a single-use previewReceipt. Nothing changes until the commit call.","type":"boolean"},"previewReceipt":{"default":null,"description":"Step 2 of the required two-step write: the receipt re